{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_45645","headline":"行路难 四 · 贯休","name":"行路难 四","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"九有茫茫共尧日，浪死虚生亦非一。\n清净玄音竟不闻，花眼酒肠暗如漆。\n或偶因片言只字登第光二亲，又不能献可替否航要津。\n口谭羲轩与周孔，履行不及屠沽人。\n行路难，行路难，日暮途远空悲叹。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"贯休","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_45645.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_45645","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"乐府","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}